n, rune magus!&quot;<br /> <br /> When they said celestial workings could grant you a burning gaze, what does it mean?</div> </div> </div> </div>I figured it was like heat vision, but yeah, mechanically, I'd just use something like Burning Name for the mechanics - maybe let them use Awareness to land the attack, but make it incompatible with Solar Awareness Charms.<br /> <br /> If you specifically wanted some sort of instant death-gaze, I'd advise you be really careful about the Finesse; after all, if you end up not being able to turn off its baleful power, it's really gonna suck when some asshole with a mirror shows up.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 04-19-2018, 08:04 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-19T16:57:28-07:00","id":1209052,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1208894#post1208894\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well, it would still seem cool. I mean seriously, deaths stare. It can't be wrong.<br /> <br /> So let's say it's supereffective against mortals. But as essence go