suppose that this is solar scale working, huh?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-14T11:25:22-07:00","id":1235025,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1235019#post1235019\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well. This is bad.<br /> <br /> I suppose that this is solar scale working, huh?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I'd say solar 1 or Celestial 3.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-14T18:20:06-07:00","id":1235126,"title":"","content":"As noted, Solar Medicine can regenerate limbs. The timeframe is &quot;pack a lunch, man.&quot; Have a look at Wholeness-Restoring Meditation.<br /> <br /> Make one roll <b>a month, </b>start counting successes once you get over 5. A lost limb is a Defining condition, so you need 20 successes to get it from Defining to Major, 20 more from Major to Minor, and 20 more for Minor to gone.<br /> <br /> This is way quicker and (relatively) easier if you managed to recover the limb (Wound-Cleansing Care, Essence 1), but to regrow a limb from nothing? That's going to take at least a year, even for a healer that performs literal miracles.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24387-amayad","name":"Amayad","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"137"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-25T15:50:51-07:00","id":1238706,"title":"","content":"Sorcerous Working to create an tiny active volcano - large enough to be used for Orichalcum production?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24362-fredo","name":"Fredo","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"24"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-25T21:16:07-07:00","id":1238781,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Fredo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1238706#post1238706\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sorcerous Working to create an tiny active volcano - large enough to be used for Orichalcum production?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I'd say that anything capable of producing any of the magical materials falls into at least Celestial-tier workings (&quot;instilling supernatural power into the mundane world.&quot;). The exact size and how much orichalcum it could produce would depend on the Ambition.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Interested in chatting with other Exalted fans online? Join us on the <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kGsyF5jhdy\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted Discord server</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1533-kelly-pedersen","name":"Kelly Pedersen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1533_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"929"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-26T00:00:56-07:00","id":1238810,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kelly Pedersen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1238781#post1238781\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> I'd say that anything capable of producing any of the magical materials falls into at least Celestial-tier workings (&amp;quot;instilling supernatural power into the mundane world.&amp;quot<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />. The exact size and how much orichalcum it could produce would depend on the Ambition.</div> </div> </div> </div>But not directly. That's the thing. <br /> <br /> Small active volcano? I'll say terrestrial 3.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-26T08:35:00-07:00","id":1238926,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Fredo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1238706#post1238706\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sorcerous Working to create an tiny active volcano - large enough to be used for Orichalcum production?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Celestial--Sounds big enough to be beyond the size of a village as far as alterations needed. I also don't think dragonblooded should be able to easily create volcanoes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-26T08:50:35-07:00","id":1238931,"title":"","content":"Celestial for sure. A 'small' volcano is like saying a 'small mountain' or a 'small sea' There is no such thing as a pocket-sized volcano (well okay maybe there is, but to create one you're looking more at reality warping effects of solar circle workings). I would also adjust the ambition dependent on <i>where</i> you're trying to make a volcano. In the south? Maybe Ambition 1-2 depending on size? In the north? Ambition 3 or solar 1? In the far west where the ocean is infinitely deep? Maybe Solar 2-3 since you're essentially conjuring molten rock from nothing.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Actually I could see it as terrestrial if you're in the south and just tapping in to an active volcano to get a manageable flow","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my homebrew exalt: The Fabulists - Chosen of the Raksha <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1141861-peach-new-exalt-splat-the-fabulist-exalts-chosen-of-the-raksha\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8804-armyofwhispers","name":"armyofwhispers","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8804_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"790"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-26T10:16:49-07:00","id":1238974,"title":"","content":"He didn't mention the size. <br /> <br /> It could just be a small field that has a magma surface.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-26T10:20:50-07:00","id":1238976,"title":"","content":"To me, it's not the size that matters so much, it's the potential magical material creation. I'll note that Arms says that forging gold into orichalcum is a &quot;lost art&quot; anyways, but even if you're assuming it's available, I don't think Terrestrial-tier sorcerers should be getting easy access to the means to do it. Hence, celestial at the lowest, to create a lava flow that's specifically suitable for making orichalcum.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Interested in chatting with other Exalted fans online? Join us on the <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kGsyF5jhdy\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted Discord server</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1533-kelly-pedersen","name":"Kelly Pedersen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1533_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"929"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-26T10:49:16-07:00","id":1238982,"title":"","content":"Well, if you accept that 2E stuff has at least some validity, then the Orichalcum refining is an adept-level alchemy procedure:<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Distill Orichalcum (2, Stamina, 3, one week): Purifying gold into orichalcum can only be done at a source of molten lava. It also requires large, high-precision mirrors to concentrate sunlight on the molten gold. Boiling the gold continuously for a week, using magma and sunfire, to drive out impurities, is not intellectually challenging... but the prolonged, constant attention to direct the mirrors and keep the lava from contaminating the gold is remarkably fatiguing. </div> </div> </div>So, the lava is part of the fuel driving the process, but its not any type of special lava, any more than the sunlight being used is special sunlight.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24362-fredo","name":"Fredo","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"24"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-26T10:57:28-07:00","id":1238985,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1238974#post1238974\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">He didn't mention the size.<br /> <br /> It could just be a small field that has a magma surface.</div> </div> </div> </div>The earlier &quot;depends on where&quot; I think is key to this--If it's in the west/in an ocean, your asking to make an island. If it's in the south, I'd be more willing to grant a Terrestrail 3 for a lava field.<br /> <br /> <i>however</i>, if it's for making orichalcum, it's going to be big enough to require refracting mirrors and the like for the task. That to me suggests a volcano big enough to warrant a celestial working.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-26T11:47:11-07:00","id":1239005,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Fredo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1238982#post1238982\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, if you accept that 2E stuff has at least some validity,</div> </div> </div> </div>I tend to assume it doesn't in this thread, since the rules for sorcerous workings are a purely 3e thing. If you want to ask about stuff in a 2e context, I'd suggest specifying that.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Fredo</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">then the Orichalcum refining is an adept-level alchemy procedure:</div> </div> </div> </div>Personally, I doubt that, if the process for refining orichalcum out of gold is ever detailed in 3e, that it will be thaumaturgy-level stuff. Rather, I suspect it would be a craft project of its own, probably Superior-level. In any case, even in 2e terms, I wouldn't let just any old lava serve the process. I think you should still need appropriately-pure lava, something that doesn't have a bunch of slag, dissolved gasses, etc. in it, that could screw up the process.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Interested in chatting with other Exalted fans online? Join us on the <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kGsyF5jhdy\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted Discord server</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1533-kelly-pedersen","name":"Kelly Pedersen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1533_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"929"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-31T03:30:51-07:00","id":1240781,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>armyofwhispers</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1238931#post1238931\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Celestial for sure. A 'small' volcano is like saying a 'small mountain' or a 'small sea' There is no such thing as a pocket-sized volcano (well okay maybe there is, but to create one you're looking more at reality warping effects of solar circle workings). I would also adjust the ambition dependent on <i>where</i> you're trying to make a volcano. In the south? Maybe Ambition 1-2 depending on size? In the north? Ambition 3 or solar 1? In the far west where the ocean is infinitely deep? Maybe Solar 2-3 since you're essentially conjuring molten rock from nothing.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Actually I could see it as terrestrial if you're in the south and just tapping in to an active volcano to get a manageable flow</div> </div> </div> </div>My group accidentally made a small volcano to use as a hotspring so they could have the onsen experience.<br /> <br /> Sorcerers, man. Sorcerers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please be warned: this is not champagne, this is most likely a duck.<br /> -<i>Chausse</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\"><i>Message me for Japanese translations.</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord","name":"Sorcerous Overlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8830_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-31T04:01:21-07:00","id":1240790,"title":"","content":"Damn. Now I'm tempted to write a bunch of sorcerous workings based around small city states ruled by a single mortal sorcerer.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-01T11:44:35-07:00","id":1241413,"title":"","content":"Eh, I'd allow a volcano to be raised in the far South at Terrestrial 3. That doesn't mean DBs can crank out Orichalcum on the regular, it means that IF they were able to rediscover the lost techniques, and IF they raised the rest of the infrastructure required (which is likely to be very pesky in the Second Age even if you know how it's done) they might be able to, given a regular supply of gold so expensive it even makes Dynasts wince, which they stand a high chance of ruining if they're not careful.<br /> <br /> Remember, &quot;gold, sunlight, a volcano and mirrors&quot; needn't be an exhaustive list of ingredients. A cake is made with flour, water and heat, but there's a little more to it than that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24387-amayad","name":"Amayad","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"137"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-01T16:58:46-07:00","id":1241565,"title":"","content":"Um.... Can't mercury ants turn iron into gold?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-01T17:10:06-07:00","id":1241572,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1241565#post1241565\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Um.... Can't mercury ants turn iron into gold?</div> </div> </div> </div>Mercury ants can transmute ten pounds of metal for five motes. What's your point?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 08-01-2018, 08:27 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-01T17:54:20-07:00","id":1241595,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1241572#post1241572\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Mercury ants can transmute ten pounds of metal for five motes. What's your point?</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, when they said &quot;regular supply of gold so expensive if even makes dynasts wince&quot;, what do they mean?<br /> <br /> How much gold?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-01T18:27:02-07:00","id":1241612,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1241595#post1241595\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, when they said &quot;regular supply of gold so expensive if even makes dynasts wince&quot;, what do they mean?<br /> <br /> How much gold?</div> </div> </div> </div>Let's see, if memory serves, you need ~3 talents of orichalcum to make a grand daiklave. A talent of jade weighs ~60 lbs., IIRC, so that means somewhere in the neighborhood of 200 lbs. of orichalcum. <br /> <br /> At a guess, I'm gonna say the &quot;smelting gold into orichalcum&quot; process isn't perfect, so let's say you need twice as much gold as the orichalcum you intend to possess, so about 400 pounds of the stuff. Which probably <i>is</i> enough to make a Dynast wince.<br /> <br /> Since a mercury ant doesn't have 200 motes handy, you're going to need to summon a number of them. <br /> <br /> And all that's assuming your character even has an idea of what mercury ants are, which seems unlikely given how they tend to live far deeper underground than most mortal communities ever mine and make a point of staying the fuck away from humans.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-01T18:59:02-07:00","id":1241623,"title":"","content":"But.... if you were to go to any sorcery school of note, or ask around, you'll find out about the ants. <br /> <br /> I mean, ants who can turn lead into gold are kinda distinctive.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-01T19:13:27-07:00","id":1241625,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1241623#post1241623\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But.... if you were to go to any sorcery school of note, or ask around, you'll find out about the ants.</div> </div> </div> </div>Will you, though? I don't feel that's really true; just because something exists in the setting doesn't mean that folks are guaranteed to know about it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-02T10:35:23-07:00","id":1241911,"title":"","content":"I'd assumed that the smelting-gold-into-orichalcum process involved a ridiculous amount of refinement and concentration, like boiling down the bones of 40 head of cattle to get demi-glace on <i>Northern Exposure</i>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3505-matt-the-bruins-fan","name":"Matt the Bruins fan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3505_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-03T04:36:15-07:00","id":1242295,"title":"","content":"Just finished the Sorcery section of Third,<br /> Binding a Demon of the Second Circle, as the spell: Demon of the Second Circle<br /> <br /> Creating a being comparable to a Second Circle Demon is Celestial 3, so Celestial Ambition 2?<br /> To get your control of the Demon equivalent to the spell, would it have to be Finesse 5? What would choosing Finesse 3 or 1 look like, here?<br /> For Means: Would you allow Demon of the First Circle as a Complementary Spell?<br /> Would you allow (for a mortal sorcerer) with Occult 5, a specialty in Demonology, and say an applicable Craft 5 the equivalent of the second Means roll an Exalt could acquire from &quot;Significant Charms related to the Complementary Ability&quot;?<br /> When it lists the various Means Alternatives, like a fellow sorcerer, a related exalt, or a group of non-sorcerer occult-aligned individuals, when it says they don't stack I'm not overthinking this..it means pick one, right?<br /> Obviously a mortal trying this would take it out to the maximum time-interval, because they are so completely screwed if this blows up in their face.<br /> <br /> <br /> Assuming I haven't gotten anything wrong (PLEASE correct me, if I have), a mortal attempting to Bind a Second Circle Demon as the spell, might look something like this then?<br /> Celestial Ambition 2, Finesse 5, Means 9 (2 Complementary Abilities, 1 for Use of Demon of the First Circle as a Complementary Spell, 1 for Cooperation, 3 for taking it out to taking 5 years during boundary-pushing, 1 for some sort of appropriate exotic component, and 1 for an extensive sorcery-workspace)<br /> <br /> Look about right? I'm extremely interested in this, because the implications of breaching the previous Circle-based hard-limits on Demonology might be rather profound. I KNOW I've got a player whose going to be wanting to do this (and then this with Third Circle Demons and a No Moon Lunar once we get the Lunars book)<br /> <br /> Edit: This is as much a thought-experiment, as anything. I'm rather wondering what the probability of such a Working NOT going horrifically wrong might be. Comments greatly appreciated <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24378,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24378-wyldwraith","user":"Wyldwraith","date":". 08-03-2018, 07:55 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24378-wyldwraith","name":"Wyldwraith","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"111"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-03T05:19:15-07:00","id":1242306,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wyldwraith</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1242295#post1242295\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Creating a being comparable to a Second Circle Demon is Celestial 3, so Celestial Ambition 2?</div> </div> </div> </div>Seems reasonable.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wyldwraith</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1242295#post1242295\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">To get your control of the Demon equivalent to the spell, would it have to be Finesse 5?</div> </div> </div> </div>That's up to you and your ST; remember, Finesse isn't contingent on how powerful the effect is, it's a function of how much executive power <i>you the player</i> have in regard to how your working manifests. So if your desire is to have it function exactly identically to DotSC, and your ST doesn't veto it, and you choose Finesse 5, then that's what you get. But if your desire is to have a hollow spot in the demon's brain where your surgically-implanted telepathy glands can directly control its body, then it won't function like the spell even at Finesse 5.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wyldwraith</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1242295#post1242295\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What would choosing Finesse 3 or 1 look like, here?</div> </div> </div> </div>That's up to you and your ST. For instance, maybe it only obeys the commands of one who bears a certain magic ring; or perhaps its life is linked to yours, so that if one of you perishes, the other dies by the same means. <br /> <br /> The demon is still going to be a loyal servant if the working succeeds and that's what you the player wanted, no matter what level Finesse you chose.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wyldwraith</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1242295#post1242295\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For Means: Would you allow Demon of the First Circle as a Complementary Spell?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wyldwraith</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1242295#post1242295\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Would you allow (for a mortal sorcerer) with Occult 5, a specialty in Demonology, and say an applicable Craft 5 the equivalent of the second Means roll an Exalt could acquire from &quot;Significant Charms related to the Complementary Ability&quot;?</div> </div> </div> </div>No.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wyldwraith</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1242295#post1242295\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">When it lists the various Means Alternatives, like a fellow sorcerer, a related exalt, or a group of non-sorcerer occult-aligned individuals, when it says they don't stack I'm not overthinking this..it means pick one, right?</div> </div> </div> </div>Right, you can't double-dip from having a sorcerer and an Exalt, or a sorcerer who <i>is</i> an Exalt, et cetera.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wyldwraith</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1242295#post1242295\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Obviously a mortal trying this would take it out to the maximum time-interval, because they are so completely screwed if this blows up in their face.</div> </div> </div> </div>Very true.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wyldwraith</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1242295#post1242295\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Look about right?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm regrettably AFB at the moment, sorry.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 08-03-2018, 08:21 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-03T14:34:52-07:00","id":1242491,"title":"","content":"Remove the need for breathing, sleep, drinking and eating. Or just breathing and sleeping. What kind of working?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4567-volivat","name":"Volivat","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"201"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-03T17:17:23-07:00","id":1242535,"title":"","content":"Thanks Count,<br /> I see a lot of interesting story-implications for Demonology with the hard Circle-limits a thing of the past. While you aren't likely to see Terrestrial sorcerers summoning Second Circle Demons for war like Samea does for the Bull, I can definitely see the &quot;Specific Demon, for long-term Master Plan-coming-to-fruition&quot; potential for a sorcerous cabal. That brings up another question: Do you think it would take ALL the sorcerers of a Dynastic House like Memnon or Ledaal to constitute the sort of &quot;rare group of organized sorcerers&quot; it talks about in Means, or just a fraction of them? If a fraction, what fraction would you say? Enough to make two such groups, or even three? (I'm thinking three is probably right out. Even if they DID have the numbers in sorcerers, getting that many together, focused on one thing would be prohibitive. Your view?)<br /> <br /> I wonder if Memnon or Ledaal could get the sort of infrastructure together with a major effort to dig deeper into Means...but I'm probably getting off-thread here.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24378-wyldwraith","name":"Wyldwraith","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"111"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-03T17:21:33-07:00","id":1242538,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Volivat</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1242491#post1242491\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Remove the need for breathing, sleep, drinking and eating. Or just breathing and sleeping. What kind of working?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd make it Celestial 1-2. Sounds like a decent supernatural power.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-03T23:02:26-07:00","id":1242620,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epee102</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1242538#post1242538\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'd make it Celestial 1-2. Sounds like a decent supernatural power.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yup. &quot;Remove all mortal needs&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-04T04:25:20-07:00","id":1242680,"title":"","content":"Really not sure where this one falls:<br /> What would you put a persistent Working that made Workings you were pushing the boundaries (by one degree) to accomplish, easier? Say in my above example, you had someone wanting to summon Demons beyond their Circle-limit, and they wanted to fashion a specific room in a building where this was more easily accomplished.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24378-wyldwraith","name":"Wyldwraith","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"111"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-04T07:44:08-07:00","id":1242715,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wyldwraith</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1242680#post1242680\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Really not sure where this one falls:<br /> What would you put a persistent Working that made Workings you were pushing the boundaries (by one degree) to accomplish, easier? Say in my above example, you had someone wanting to summon Demons beyond their Circle-limit, and they wanted to fashion a specific room in a building where this was more easily accomplished.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sigh. Solar.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-04T07:53:45-07:00","id":1242718,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1242715#post1242715\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sigh.</div> </div> </div> </div>Why the sigh?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-04T08:46:36-07:00","id":1242726,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wyldwraith</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1242680#post1242680\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What would you put a persistent Working that made Workings you were pushing the boundaries (by one degree) to accomplish, easier? Say in my above example, you had someone wanting to summon Demons beyond their Circle-limit, and they wanted to fashion a specific room in a building where this was more easily accomplished.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm not sure I'd ever allow &quot;one degree easier&quot;. Making summoning 2nd Circle demons into a Terrestrial 1 working just wouldn't, well, work. What I would allow is a working to count as a Means for other workings if it was at the same Circle and Ambition (so, for example, a Terrestrial 1 working would serve as a means to summon a 1st Circle demon). I might allow a working three levels higher than the target working to reduce the target by one ambition level, but that would never reduce the target's actual circle, so applying it to Terrestrial 1 or Celestial 1 workings would be useless.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Interested in chatting with other Exalted fans online? Join us on the <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kGsyF5jhdy\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted Discord server</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1533-kelly-pedersen","name":"Kelly Pedersen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1533_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"929"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-04T08:57:00-07:00","id":1242732,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kelly Pedersen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1242726#post1242726\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm not sure I'd ever allow &quot;one degree easier&quot;. Making summoning 2nd Circle demons into a Terrestrial 1 working just wouldn't, well, work. What I would allow is a working to count as a Means for other workings if it was at the same Circle and Ambition (so, for example, a Terrestrial 1 working would serve as a means to summon a 1st Circle demon). I might allow a working three levels higher than the target working to reduce the target by one ambition level, but that would never reduce the target's actual circle, so applying it to Terrestrial 1 or Celestial 1 workings would be useless.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Expanding on this, I'd even allow a working that's a generic help with a type of working: A portal to Malfeas makes summoning a demon from malfeas or using malefic energies easier (reflected by an extra means)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-04T09:50:26-07:00","id":1242742,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epee102</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1242732#post1242732\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Expanding on this, I'd even allow a working that's a generic help with a type of working: A portal to Malfeas makes summoning a demon from malfeas or using malefic energies easier (reflected by an extra means)</div> </div> </div> </div>I think I'd rule that a couple such workings are basically part of the &quot;Sorcerous Infrastructure&quot; Means, in fact.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Interested in chatting with other Exalted fans online? Join us on the <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kGsyF5jhdy\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted Discord server</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1533-kelly-pedersen","name":"Kelly Pedersen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1533_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"929"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-04T10:26:41-07:00","id":1242748,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1242718#post1242718\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Why the sigh?</div> </div> </div> </div>I perfectly get why someone would do this. Everyone wants a second circle demon. <br /> <br /> Problem. If you can't summon a second circle, you're a first circle. <br /> <br /> A supernatural, to decrease the difficulty in making a sorcerous working to summon a second circle? <br /> <br /> Has to be solar. <br /> <br /> Our friend here is wasting his time, and is doomed, to be forced to get excessively large numbers of successes to get a second circle demon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-05T22:45:04-07:00","id":1243124,"title":"","content":"Well,<br /> If the game didn't want Terrestrial sorcerers mustering 2nd-Circle Demons and such, you wouldn't be able to CREATE equivalent beings at such a level. I agree that trying to generate Workings that affect Circle-boundary-pushing (whatever the application) would eventually make the Circle-limits so vulnerable to the application of prep-time as to make all but on-the-spot (which Workings don't do, anyways) sorcery meaningless.<br /> <br /> I'm betting the EX3 Sorcery-book is going to be a FASCINATING read. The core write-ups of places like Ysr, and the ten-fathers locale are the tip of the iceberg.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24378-wyldwraith","name":"Wyldwraith","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"111"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-06T09:24:23-07:00","id":1243225,"title":"","content":"I just want more spell guidelines.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-06T09:30:21-07:00","id":1243228,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wyldwraith</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1243124#post1243124\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well,<br /> If the game didn't want Terrestrial sorcerers mustering 2nd-Circle Demons and such, you wouldn't be able to CREATE equivalent beings at such a level. I agree that trying to generate Workings that affect Circle-boundary-pushing (whatever the application) would eventually make the Circle-limits so vulnerable to the application of prep-time as to make all but on-the-spot (which Workings don't do, anyways) sorcery meaningless.<br /> <br /> I'm betting the EX3 Sorcery-book is going to be a FASCINATING read. The core write-ups of places like Ysr, and the ten-fathers locale are the tip of the iceberg.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Notably, Terrestrail Sorcerers can call unbound 2nd circles w/a Celestial 2 ambition. I'm AFB atm, so i forget how hard that is, but certainly you can have a mortal sorcerer/cult leader conjuring her patron god from Malfeas.<br /> <br /> Now, <i>binding</i> them is trickier--and certainly, Terrestrial sorcerers have to work harder to summon them. <br /> <br /> I don't think the Yennin (Ten Fathered) are sorcerery though--we'll get stats on them in Eight Directions.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-06T15:12:12-07:00","id":1243308,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epee102</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1243228#post1243228\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Notably, Terrestrail Sorcerers can call unbound 2nd circles w/a Celestial 2 ambition. I'm AFB atm, so i forget how hard that is,</div> </div> </div> </div>Summoning an unbound demon of 1st or 2nd Circle is an Ambition 1 working of the relevant circle. Notably, 3rd Circle demons are <i>not</i> listed in Solar 1, which I strongly suspect is not accidental. If it were possible to summon unbound Unquestionable into the world, some incautious sorcerer would have done it at some point, and they could have destroyed or otherwise grossly changed a large chunk of Creation - the Unquestionable are not to be fucked with.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Interested in chatting with other Exalted fans online? Join us on the <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kGsyF5jhdy\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted Discord server</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1533-kelly-pedersen","name":"Kelly Pedersen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1533_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"929"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-08T20:18:46-07:00","id":1244034,"title":"","content":"Forget me if I don't read the whole thread, but what do you feel would be the appropriate level of Ambition for a small &quot;zone of truth&quot; effect?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13447-quolise","name":"Quolise","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-08T20:33:41-07:00","id":1244036,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Quolise</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1244034#post1244034\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">what do you feel would be the appropriate level of Ambition for a small &quot;zone of truth&quot; effect?</div> </div> </div> </div>Depends on what you mean by &quot;zone of truth&quot; and &quot;small&quot;, really. For Terrestrial Ambition 1, I'd allow a patch big enough for one person (or maybe a couple if they're <i>very </i>good friends), which would effectively Read Intentions on someone within it, and if it overcame their Guile, react in some way to a lie. For Terrestrial 2, you'd get either a bit more detail (the lie indicator could tell which <i>part</i> of a statement was a lie, for example), or more area (enough to cover a few people). For Terrestrial 3, I'd start allowing the working to effectively make social influence rolls to compel people to tell the truth, though that would still be resistable by the regular mechanics. At Celestial 1, I'd probably allow outright mind control/psyche effects to compel the truth, and for it to cover a reasonably large area (a large room, for instance), and be controllable, so a designated person could hit people with the effect selectively within the area.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Interested in chatting with other Exalted fans online? Join us on the <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kGsyF5jhdy\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted Discord server</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1533-kelly-pedersen","name":"Kelly Pedersen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1533_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"929"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-12T09:23:35-07:00","id":1245123,"title":"","content":"I remember someone creating working where a sorcerer can create or dispel supernatural merits using a base pool of Essence x 10 dots","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-12T21:15:57-07:00","id":1245315,"title":"","content":"Question. You give the person a supernatural power on the level of a spell. What ambition is it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-12T21:45:05-07:00","id":1245327,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1245315#post1245315\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Question. You give the person a supernatural power on the level of a spell. What ambition is it?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Celestial 2 as a base at least. Depends on the spell level and the spell--for isntance, innately able to summon demons would probably be Celesital 3-Solar 1","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-12T21:51:27-07:00","id":1245329,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epee102</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1245327#post1245327\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Celestial 2 as a base at least. Depends on the spell level and the spell--for isntance, innately able to summon demons would probably be Celesital 3-Solar 1</div> </div> </div> </div>Transform yourself into living bronze or have the healing power of a sesseljae.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-16T11:33:45-07:00","id":1246711,"title":"","content":"My comment about binding 2nd-Circle Demons by Terrestrial sorcerers was meant to highlight it being something that will obviously be done by Terrestrial sorcerers, since outright <b>creation of </b>a 2nd-Circle-equivalent being is possible for them. I would imagine binding of preexisting 2nd-Circle Demons would be vastly more common among Terrestrial sorcerers than creation of beings of similar power. If for no other reason than demonology is a preexisting discipline of occult knowledge.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24378-wyldwraith","name":"Wyldwraith","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"111"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-19T08:42:11-07:00","id":1247716,"title":"","content":"Can something with the power of a 1st circle or 2nd circle demon exist, without a more pool?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-19T08:48:07-07:00","id":1247718,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1247716#post1247716\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Can something with the power of a 1st circle or 2nd circle demon exist, without a more pool?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd argue that a tyrant lizard is more powerful than a blood ape, and a tyrant lizard doesn't have a mote pool.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-19T08:49:56-07:00","id":1247719,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1247718#post1247718\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd argue that a tyrant lizard is more powerful than a blood ape, and a tyrant lizard doesn't have a mote pool.</div> </div> </div> </div>Personal headcanon: sorcerers have been morphing and altering themselves for millennia. But at their core, no matter their changes, they are still mortal humans who grabbed the might of sorcery. <br /> <br /> Which makes for some very odd looking exalted....","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-19T08:54:52-07:00","id":1247722,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1247719#post1247719\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Personal headcanon: sorcerers have been morphing and altering themselves for millennia. But at their core, no matter their changes, they are still mortal humans who grabbed the might of sorcery.<br /> <br /> Which makes for some very odd looking exalted....</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I mean, one of my vilians is a Solar who has warped himself into a man-of-war/manta ray/crab monster who lives in the sky. He still has an anima banner though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-19T08:59:23-07:00","id":1247726,"title":"","content":"Ok. Anyway, a player in this forum once posted his sorcerous workings...<br /> <br /> Ok. <br /> <br /> 1. Chamber to elsewhere, to put in sorcerous gates.<br /> <br /> 2. Sorcerous gates to other parts of creation.<br /> <br /> 3. Translation field stretching over a city","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-19T09:16:21-07:00","id":1247731,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1247726#post1247726\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ok. Anyway, a player in this forum once posted his sorcerous workings...<br /> <br /> Ok.<br /> <br /> 1. Chamber to elsewhere, to put in sorcerous gates.<br /> <br /> 2. Sorcerous gates to other parts of creation.<br /> <br /> 3. Translation field stretching over a city</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> 3. Translation field? As in--everyone in the city understands each other perfectly? Sounds Solar from scale alone.<br /> <br /> 1&amp;2. 1 is clearly a Celestial 3 or Terrestrial 3--Celestial 3 if it's a 'gate' to elsewhere, Terrestrial if it's a room that replicates the conditions of elsewhere. The gating...I'd say Celestial 2-3? Again, it's connecting to antoher place. 3 if it's as significant as a connection to Malfeas, 2 if it's not. If people move to like...a hub of the elsehwere room I'd count that as a means (I had a player do this and it was celestial+an artifact).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-19T09:24:09-07:00","id":1247734,"title":"","content":"The room is basically a pocket extending into elsewhere space, meant to act as a hub for the next few gates.<br /> <br /> So... portal to another place = celestial 2?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-19T09:41:13-07:00","id":1247742,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1247734#post1247734\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The room is basically a pocket extending into elsewhere space, meant to act as a hub for the next few gates.</div> </div> </div> </div>So, less an actual functional portal to Elsewhere, more just a piece of the infrastructure for a larger Working?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-19T09:44:25-07:00","id":1247745,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1247742#post1247742\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, less an actual functional portal to Elsewhere, more just a piece of the infrastructure for a larger Working?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yep. Just a chamber. Nothing that exotic","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-19T19:43:01-07:00","id":1247875,"title":"","content":"An idea. What about, say, a self-propelled boat that can fly? <br /> <br /> Its, like, a boat that has keel above the clouds, stormwind rider enchantment, and calling the wind's kiss cast permanently.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-19T19:55:29-07:00","id":1247878,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1247875#post1247875\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">An idea. What about, say, a self-propelled boat that can fly?<br /> <br /> Its, like, a boat that has keel above the clouds, stormwind rider enchantment, and calling the wind's kiss cast permanently.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I...would argue for terrestrial, depending on the boat size, for the first one at least. I'm unfamilar with the last spell, and Storwind rider would be Celestial 1.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-19T19:57:20-07:00","id":1247879,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epee102</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1247878#post1247878\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> I...would argue for terrestrial, depending on the boat size, for the first one at least. I'm unfamilar with the last spell, and Storwind rider would be Celestial 1.</div> </div> </div> </div>Calling the wind's kiss basically means the ship has the wind behind it, always.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-19T20:05:44-07:00","id":1247882,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1247879#post1247879\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Calling the wind's kiss basically means the ship has the wind behind it, always.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Oh right! That's a hearthstone right? <br /> <br /> Alrighty: A boat that can fly permanetly (and has some mechanism for raising and lowering) seems Terrestrial. Peramant wind and super speed in addition is Celestial 1 or 2 (I'd allow any 1 of these as Terrestrial, but combined it goes up a notch. So as alternative, you could layer the workigns.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-19T20:13:07-07:00","id":1247883,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epee102</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1247882#post1247882\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Oh right! That's a hearthstone right?<br /> <br /> Alrighty: A boat that can fly permanetly (and has some mechanism for raising and lowering) seems Terrestrial. Peramant wind and super speed in addition is Celestial 1 or 2 (I'd allow any 1 of these as Terrestrial, but combined it goes up a notch. So as alternative, you could layer the workigns.)</div> </div> </div> </div>Gah. No. Its a terrestrial spell. Basically, wind conditions are always favourable. I would add in Magician's pleasant path and mystic travel, too. <br /> <br /> So yes, layered workings. I'm just thinking of, say, a pirate sorcerer, who flies above creation and lands next to unlucky villages to raid them, then fly up again to avoid reprisal. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-19T20:15:00-07:00","id":1247884,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1247883#post1247883\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Gah. No. Its a terrestrial spell. Basically, wind conditions are always favourable. I would add in Magician's pleasant path and mystic travel, too.<br /> <br /> So yes, layered workings. I'm just thinking of, say, a pirate sorcerer, who flies above creation and lands next to unlucky villages to raid them, then fly up again to avoid reprisal.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Oh yeah, I'd do a series of Terrestrial workings for that. Sounds legit (and if it's cool enough and the pirates an NPC, you can always have them get <i>really</i> luck on dice or have found it. Players don't need to see the rolls).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-19T20:20:06-07:00","id":1247887,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epee102</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1247884#post1247884\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Oh yeah, I'd do a series of Terrestrial workings for that. Sounds legit (and if it's cool enough and the pirates an NPC, you can always have them get <i>really</i> luck on dice or have found it. Players don't need to see the rolls).</div> </div> </div> </div>Yep. Anyway, I need another idea. <br /> <br /> So I'm thinking of sorcery and summoning the harvest. And you know what? I think I'm going to think of sorcery that works for strategic scale. Stuff that helps nations or something. <br /> <br /> So let's start with a manse. Task bind to it Sesseljae and Sky-sewn brides. Let it produce a liquid that soothes pain and speeds up healing. Doable?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-19T21:34:42-07:00","id":1247903,"title":"","content":"Question. How about an eternally-replenishing mine? Terrestrial or Celestial?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-19T22:08:59-07:00","id":1247907,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1247887#post1247887\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yep. Anyway, I need another idea.<br /> <br /> So I'm thinking of sorcery and summoning the harvest. And you know what? I think I'm going to think of sorcery that works for strategic scale. Stuff that helps nations or something.<br /> <br /> So let's start with a manse. Task bind to it Sesseljae and Sky-sewn brides. Let it produce a liquid that soothes pain and speeds up healing. Doable?</div> </div> </div> </div>Uhhh, weeeellll<br /> So this is relevant to my game--although my players aren't on here anymore I think. But I've put some thought on 'strategic' sorcery. So, thoughts:<br /> A manse is...well, you don't need a working for that and I feel like if there is one thing this edition lacks, its strong rules/guidelines on manses. Making a fountain that makes magic health potions would be a celestial or solar ranking--there's lots of details here, and I lean Celestial 3, but I could see someone push it to Solar.<br /> <br /> as for an eternally replinishing mine--sounds like Celestial 2-3, depending on the size of the mine...I think someone asked about it somewhere on here before. Oh, and of course, what your mining. &quot;Eternal supply of jade forever&quot; is harder than &quot;rockquarry that never runs out&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-20T01:18:21-07:00","id":1247944,"title":"","content":"Well... I was more like thinking of a hospital or something. <br /> <br /> And as for the mine, its... well, think of it as marble or good quality iron ore. Just plain normal materials. Sure, you can conjure it up using elementals, but its such a hassle. So make a working.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-21T23:30:20-07:00","id":1248637,"title":"","content":"I have an idea. A mixture of ablative health levels, and extra lives. <br /> <br /> Let's say the sorcerer does a working on himself. Terrestrial/ Celestial. Each working gives him one life. How? <br /> <br /> Here's how. It, in essence, gives him a duplicate extra health levels. Struck by a mountain shattering blow? He dies... and reforms. Sure, that blow can blow through 10 health levels with ease, but he can reform himself after that, since each attack doesn't spill over to the next 'life'. Each 'life' acts as a bargain basement perfect defense. Sure, he can get hit. It doesn't make him any tougher. Just means that you have to kill him continuously.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-28T01:40:13-07:00","id":1249299,"title":"","content":"An idea for senses. A sorcerous working to automatically get details and a precise analysis on anything or anyone you focus on. Must be one thing. <br /> <br /> Roll intelligence + awareness, to get details on your subject. Each success is one detail. Ranges from 'loves this man' to 'has a liking for mochi'. <br /> <br /> Spend a willpower to get (intelligence) successes. <br /> <br /> From here:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://ruscumag.wordpress.com/2011/01/11/exalted-mutations-iii-movement-senses-and-life-support/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"http://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/24/Touch_five_senses_MBA_Lyon_L278.jpg/300px-Touch_five_senses_MBA_Lyon_L278.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://ruscumag.wordpress.com/2011/01/11/exalted-mutations-iii-movement-senses-and-life-support/\" target=\"_blank\"> Exalted Mutations III &ndash; Movement, Senses, and Life Support </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://ruscumag.wordpress.com/2011/01/11/exalted-mutations-iii-movement-senses-and-life-support/\" target=\"_blank\"> https://ruscumag.wordpress.com/2011/01/11/exalted-mutations-iii-movement-senses-and-life-support/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> So far, Part I (basic rules and Essence Awakening) and Part II (Healing and Durability), have covered some of the most basic functions &ndash; so next up we have enhanced movement modes, unusual se&hellip; </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-28T02:05:54-07:00","id":1249307,"title":"","content":"So you're basically giving yourself a supernatural power that obviates the Investigation Ability, as well as the Read Intentions function of Socialize?<br /> <br /> \u200bI wouldn't grant it at my table, but some other sort of magical analysis, I'd say is fine for Celestial 2.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 08-28-2018, 05:08 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-28T02:12:16-07:00","id":1249309,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1249307#post1249307\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So you're basically giving yourself a supernatural power that obviates the Investigation Ability, as well as the Read Intentions function of Socialize?<br /> <br /> \u200bI wouldn't grant it at my table, but some other sort of magical analysis, I'd say is fine for Celestial 2.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hmm.... any suggestions so that it doesn't fuck up the investigation thing?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-28T05:46:02-07:00","id":1249344,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1249309#post1249309\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Hmm.... any suggestions so that it doesn't fuck up the investigation thing?</div> </div> </div> </div>Have it take an investigation roll? Maybe just have it reduce to time for Profile Character actions?<br /> Have it give a collection of raw data - his shoes are worn, she has a scar on her right arm - and don't give meaning or context?<br /> <br /> Also, enhanced senses seems more like a perception roll than an intelligence roll","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23597-autxauty","name":"autXautY","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"286"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-28T06:06:19-07:00","id":1249354,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>autXautY</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1249344#post1249344\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Have it take an investigation roll? Maybe just have it reduce to time for Profile Character actions?<br /> Have it give a collection of raw data - his shoes are worn, she has a scar on her right arm - and don't give meaning or context?<br /> <br /> Also, enhanced senses seems more like a perception roll than an intelligence roll</div> </div> </div> </div>But how much raw data?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-29T13:10:39-07:00","id":1249765,"title":"","content":"Working Idea: Turning a person into a Living Dream. They still exist in Creation, but can only interact with people if they sleep where the victim would be if the victim were still physical (and maybe if someone dreams of the place where the victim would be; events that may or may not happen post-transformation are very much unintended side-effects, and so are very ST fiat).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/665-shkspr1048","name":"shkspr1048","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"630"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-29T13:53:55-07:00","id":1249776,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>shkspr1048</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1249765#post1249765\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Working Idea: Turning a person into a Living Dream. They still exist in Creation, but can only interact with people if they sleep where the victim would be if the victim were still physical (and maybe if someone dreams of the place where the victim would be; events that may or may not happen post-transformation are very much unintended side-effects, and so are very ST fiat).</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Personally, I'd peg this at Celestial 3. It's giving someone supernatural powers, effectively, which is Celestial 2, but the Celestial 2 description specifies a <i>willing</i> target, so I think doing it as a curse should require a bit more power, hence Celestial 3 rather than 2. <br /> <br /> That said, I think it's a pretty cool idea for a spell, too, which I'd put as a Celestial Circle one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Interested in chatting with other Exalted fans online? Join us on the <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kGsyF5jhdy\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted Discord server</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1533-kelly-pedersen","name":"Kelly Pedersen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1533_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"929"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-29T14:31:25-07:00","id":1249785,"title":"","content":"My players recently \u201cbefriended\u201d (<a href=\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/DefeatMeansFriendship\" target=\"_blank\">https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.p...eansFriendship</a>) Suddenly Diamonds, a fairfolk artisan. However all the other characters at the table either can\u2019t abide faire folk fearing on mortals, or have defining intimacies of hatred against the fair folk. The sorcerer wants to try and make it respite essence normally in creation without needing to feed. For the time I said no.<br /> <br /> Would you alow this at a table? What circle?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24102-tweedbarista","name":"Tweedbarista","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-29T14:58:21-07:00","id":1249793,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tweedbarista</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1249785#post1249785\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The sorcerer wants to try and make it respite essence normally in creation without needing to feed. <br /> <br /> Would you alow this at a table? What circle?</div> </div> </div> </div>At Celestial 2, I'd allow altering a fair folk (under the &quot;Make alterations to the nature of a willing supernatural being...&quot; clause) so that it could feed on something less... offensive than human emotions. Perhaps it could get a charge out of meditating on art, for example. To completely remove the necessity of feeding at all, I'd probably call for a Solar 1 working - that feels transformative on a level comparable to &quot;remove someone's soul and transfer it to another vessel&quot; or &quot;restore someone to the prime of youth&quot;. And I'd definitely make it clear this was a one-at-a-time deal. At the very least, changing the feeding nature of all fair folk everywhere would require them all to be <i>willing</i>, and it would still be Solar 3.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Interested in chatting with other Exalted fans online? Join us on the <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kGsyF5jhdy\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted Discord server</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1533-kelly-pedersen","name":"Kelly Pedersen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1533_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"929"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-29T20:04:29-07:00","id":1249863,"title":"","content":"I just had a hilarious idea. <br /> <br /> You know organ transplants? How about plants that grow organs. To be eaten, or to be used for transplant surgeries. <br /> <br /> Growing on vines like berries and fruits.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-30T06:29:34-07:00","id":1249947,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1249863#post1249863\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I just had a hilarious idea.<br /> <br /> You know organ transplants? How about plants that grow organs. To be eaten, or to be used for transplant surgeries.<br /> <br /> Growing on vines like berries and fruits.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Pfft, amateur.&quot; -The Forest Witches.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24387-amayad","name":"Amayad","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"137"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-30T07:46:20-07:00","id":1249965,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Amayad</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1249947#post1249947\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> &quot;Pfft, amateur.&quot; -The Forest Witches.</div> </div> </div> </div>Woah. Tell me more.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-31T12:44:09-07:00","id":1250302,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epee102</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1247722#post1247722\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> I mean, one of my vilians is a Solar who has warped himself into a man-of-war/manta ray/crab monster who lives in the sky. He still has an anima banner though.</div> </div> </div> </div>Which reminds me. Can you turn yourself into a being on the level of a 1st circle demon? If so, does that mean you're no longer a mortal? Or a mortal with sorcerous enhancements?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-31T12:53:07-07:00","id":1250306,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1250302#post1250302\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Which reminds me. Can you turn yourself into a being on the level of a 1st circle demon? If so, does that mean you're no longer a mortal? Or a mortal with sorcerous enhancements?</div> </div> </div> </div>Very case dependent. I\u2019d say no reason for you to become Aldrazi, the Lord Of Flame, who can become smoke and ride the wind or breath flames from his mouth\u2014and be banned from exalting as solar or lunar or dB or etc","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-04T09:07:05-07:00","id":1251402,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>shkspr1048</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1249765#post1249765\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Working Idea: Turning a person into a Living Dream. They still exist in Creation, but can only interact with people if they sleep where the victim would be if the victim were still physical (and maybe if someone dreams of the place where the victim would be; events that may or may not happen post-transformation are very much unintended side-effects, and so are very ST fiat).</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Solar 2, changing the nature of a beings soul is where I would peg that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2325-builder","name":"Builder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2325_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-05T13:39:10-07:00","id":1251749,"title":"","content":"What if I make multiple bodies I control as an exalted sorcerer? Celesitial 3 or Solar 2?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-05T14:00:37-07:00","id":1251755,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epee102</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1251749#post1251749\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What if I make multiple bodies I control as an exalted sorcerer? Celesitial 3 or Solar 2?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I'd have to know a bit more about the details to give a firm answer. Are we talking about multiple bodies, but you can only &quot;operate&quot; one at a time, and while you're controlling one, all the others are just like puppets with the strings cut? Or can you operate them all at the same time, and get multiple actions? If it's the latter, what are the restrictions on doing so? Do you have to do constant flurry penalties? Or can you operate 10 of you as easily as 1? Do you share mote pools? And so on. Also, what's the implications if one body is killed? Do you die? Or does someone have to hunt down <i>all</i> of your bodies to kill you for good?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Interested in chatting with other Exalted fans online? Join us on the <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kGsyF5jhdy\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted Discord server</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1533-kelly-pedersen","name":"Kelly Pedersen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1533_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"929"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-05T15:06:15-07:00","id":1251771,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kelly Pedersen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1251755#post1251755\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> I'd have to know a bit more about the details to give a firm answer. Are we talking about multiple bodies, but you can only &quot;operate&quot; one at a time, and while you're controlling one, all the others are just like puppets with the strings cut? Or can you operate them all at the same time, and get multiple actions? If it's the latter, what are the restrictions on doing so? Do you have to do constant flurry penalties? Or can you operate 10 of you as easily as 1? Do you share mote pools? And so on. Also, what's the implications if one body is killed? Do you die? Or does someone have to hunt down <i>all</i> of your bodies to kill you for good?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Hmmm...My thought was having multiple bodies operating at the sametime, which for an exalt would push it into Solar 3 territory (Maybe Solar 2 if they can't use charms in the copies but still). Even if it was &quot;1 body at a time, sharing everything&quot; I think this is actually solar (Even ignoring if you can M. Bison to immortality)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-05T19:07:27-07:00","id":1251810,"title":"","content":"I just realized something. Guys, lets say you make a flying ship. No water resistance. Cast calling the wind's kiss, making it so that the wind is always favourable. How fast can the ship go?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-05T21:18:15-07:00","id":1251830,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epee102</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1251771#post1251771\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmmm...My thought was having multiple bodies operating at the sametime, which for an exalt would push it into Solar 3 territory (Maybe Solar 2 if they can't use charms in the copies but still). Even if it was &quot;1 body at a time, sharing everything&quot; I think this is actually solar (Even ignoring if you can M. Bison to immortality)</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, any one of &quot;multiple actions at once&quot; and &quot;can't be killed until you kill <i>everyone</i>&quot; would push it to Solar, to me. Both is definitely Solar 2 or even 3, and I don't think I'd <i>ever</i> allow &quot;multiple bodies, all with their own mote pools and no shared resources&quot;. At that point, you're basically creating a bunch of new Exalts, and that's just beyond sorcery. <br /> <br /> Now, if the setup was &quot;multiple bodies, but there's still a 'prime' body which killing kills everyone, and you can only control one at a time&quot;, then I could maybe see this as Celestial 3.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Interested in chatting with other Exalted fans online? Join us on the <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kGsyF5jhdy\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted Discord server</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1533-kelly-pedersen","name":"Kelly Pedersen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1533_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"929"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-08T04:03:08-07:00","id":1252473,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1249965#post1249965\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Woah. Tell me more.</div> </div> </div> </div>Fielding this belatedly.<br /> <br /> The Forest Witches are a bunch of supremely odd Outcaste DBs. Their little slice of Creation is a spot where a First Age Solar butchered her handmaiden in a fit of pique, stringing her entrails through the trees, setting her eyes in flowers, bracing roots with her bones and so on.<br /> <br /> Because life and death function oddly in that place, that woman is still alive after a fashion. She's about as close to a sentient forest as one can reasonably get, and she manifests little miracles for her friends, which usually involve some combination of greenery and meat.<br /> <br /> As to the actual working? I'd say a tree that grows organs would be Terrestrial 3 or Celestial 1, depending on how you interpret &quot;create an entirely new but mundane form of life&quot;. I'd be inclined toward Terrestrial 3, since making weird chimerical animals is within the Terrestrial circle.<br /> <br /> A tree that happens to grow hearts rather than fruit is just taking two things from the natural world and smacking them together in the same way that breeding an owlbear is.<br /> <br /> Good luck actually finding a surgeon in the Age of Sorrows that can perform organ transplants without killing people, but if you're a Twilight who thinks Medicine and Occult are two great tastes that go great together, a grove of meat trees would be Exceptional Equipment for certain tasks.<br /> <br /> Or, y'know, maybe it just happens to be medically useful (for extremely gifted surgeons) but it wasn't intended to be. How else are you going to teach your society of mutant tiger-men about the art of agriculture?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24387-amayad","name":"Amayad","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"137"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-08T06:08:11-07:00","id":1252496,"title":"","content":"Also, it could be a good stunt. Protein is very useful.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-08T10:11:16-07:00","id":1252534,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Amayad</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1252473#post1252473\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Fielding this belatedly.<br /> <br /> The Forest Witches are a bunch of supremely odd Outcaste DBs. Their little slice of Creation is a spot where a First Age Solar butchered her handmaiden in a fit of pique, stringing her entrails through the trees, setting her eyes in flowers, bracing roots with her bones and so on.<br /> <br /> Because life and death function oddly in that place, that woman is still alive after a fashion. She's about as close to a sentient forest as one can reasonably get, and she manifests little miracles for her friends, which usually involve some combination of greenery and meat.<br /> <br /> As to the actual working? I'd say a tree that grows organs would be Terrestrial 3 or Celestial 1, depending on how you interpret &amp;quot;create an entirely new but mundane form of life&amp;quot;. I'd be inclined toward Terrestrial 3, since making weird chimerical animals is within the Terrestrial circle.<br /> <br /> A tree that happens to grow hearts rather than fruit is just taking two things from the natural world and smacking them together in the same way that breeding an owlbear is.<br /> <br /> Good luck actually finding a surgeon in the Age of Sorrows that can perform organ transplants without killing people, but if you're a Twilight who thinks Medicine and Occult are two great tastes that go great together, a grove of meat trees would be Exceptional Equipment for certain tasks.<br /> <br /> Or, y'know, maybe it just happens to be medically useful (for extremely gifted surgeons) but it wasn't intended to be. How else are you going to teach your society of mutant tiger-men about the art of agriculture?</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh hey. I just realized. <br /> <br /> What about cotton plants that create wool? Or coconuts that produce milk?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-08T15:53:12-07:00","id":1252617,"title":"","content":"So, granting mutations to one person is Terrestrial 2, while mutating an entire ecosystem is Celestial 2.<br /> <br /> Where would you put a small group of, say, 10 people? Terrestrial 3 or Celestial 1?<br /> <br /> How about a bigger group of 100 people? Would that hit the Celestial 2 level, or would it still be a bit below that?<br /> <br /> Bonus question: At what level would you put a permanent version of a Cloud Person's blessing i.e. making the recipient almost weightless: light enough to walk in the aerial cities or for a cloud person to carry in flight... but without the drawback of only being able to endure the blessing for a month each year on threat of disintegrating?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Let us take men and give them the favor of the gods and use them as our champions against the Primordials, that we might overthrow them and play for ourselves the Games of Divinity.&quot;","edited":{"userid":2272,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2272-senresk","user":"senresk","date":". 09-08-2018, 06:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2272-senresk","name":"senresk","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"51"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-17T05:46:09-07:00","id":1254978,"title":"","content":"Question. I've been thinking of light, and shit. <br /> <br /> What say you of a crystal that permanently glows. And can self-replicate. Any mortal that holds it and expends one willpower, can cause it to duplicate itself. Its the size of your fist, and glows as brightly as a light bulb.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-18T09:30:59-07:00","id":1255277,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1254978#post1254978\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Question. I've been thinking of light, and shit.<br /> <br /> What say you of a crystal that permanently glows. And can self-replicate. Any mortal that holds it and expends one willpower, can cause it to duplicate itself. Its the size of your fist, and glows as brightly as a light bulb.</div> </div> </div> </div>If that's within the purview of sorcery and not Craft, the fact that it hasn't been done by The Realm suggests it's beyond Terrestrial.<br /> <br /> Cheap on-demand lighting for everybody forever is a Huge Freakin' Deal,","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24387-amayad","name":"Amayad","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"137"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-18T17:00:43-07:00","id":1255365,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Amayad</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1255277#post1255277\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> If that's within the purview of sorcery and not Craft, the fact that it hasn't been done by The Realm suggests it's beyond Terrestrial.<br /> <br /> Cheap on-demand lighting for everybody forever is a Huge Freakin' Deal,</div> </div> </div> </div>Problem. Sorcerers are rare. Sorcerers who give a shit about peasantry to make lights for them? Rarer.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-18T17:29:19-07:00","id":1255374,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1255365#post1255365\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Problem. Sorcerers are rare. Sorcerers who give a shit about peasantry to make lights for them? Rarer.</div> </div> </div> </div>The replication is the problem. If each person spends a wp point a day and gives or sells the created light source to another then after 20 days there are a million of the things. Doesnt matter how rare sorcerers are, as soon as 1 exists in the hands of someone willing to sell it to make a profit or just to be generous they would spread across creation. Even if you change it to 1 wp a week or month it is still exponential growth. They will initially be valuable for merchants but before long there will be an excess of supply as everyone has them and can create more.<br /> <br /> I would think something along the lines of having a master stone that is the only one capable of creating the duplicates and the duplicates lasting for a month or a week will prevent it from being setting breaking.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5167-klaek","name":"Klaek","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-18T17:31:13-07:00","id":1255375,"title":"","content":"Huh. Or maybe the master crystal is just like a normal crystal, that has to be placed in a bath of specialized minerals to grow bigger?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-18T18:14:50-07:00","id":1255388,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Amayad</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1255277#post1255277\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Cheap on-demand lighting for everybody forever is a Huge Freakin' Deal,</div> </div> </div> </div>How much of a big deal?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-18T21:40:12-07:00","id":1255421,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1255388#post1255388\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How much of a big deal?</div> </div> </div> </div>Depending on the limitations, or lack thereof, huge big deal.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-18T21:44:41-07:00","id":1255422,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1255421#post1255421\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Depending on the limitations, or lack thereof, huge big deal.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh man. This sounds interesting tell me more.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-19T06:09:41-07:00","id":1255466,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1255422#post1255422\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh man. This sounds interesting tell me more.</div> </div> </div> </div>What more needs to be said?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-19T09:19:29-07:00","id":1255506,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1255422#post1255422\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Oh man. This sounds interesting tell me more.</div> </div> </div> </div>Look into how people lived before electric lighting, and then remember, that's how Creation is. People don't burn torches and candles all night every night, those are expendable resources and the cost would add up real quick. Practically everybody gets up early to maximize their daylight hours, and practically nobody does anything at night because.. Nobody can see goose shit.<br /> <br /> If indoor lighting were a commonplace thing? Well, people wouldn't need to worry about not having enough daylight. A lot more stuff would get done in winter/summer, whichever is the brutal non-farming season in your corner of creation. The South in particular would lap this stuff up, since nobody wants to be out doing things at noon in Resplendent Fire anyway. You just invented the concept of the nightlife. and made Charioscuro the City That Never Sleeps.<br /> <br /> The Guild's idea of a &quot;work day&quot; would change for the worse. If they can make slaves and the exploited underclass labor for twelve hours a day and extract more profit thereby, they will. And everyone else will have to keep up, won't they?<br /> <br /> With people now commonly doing commerce and labor at night. you're going to need a much beefier night watch if you don't want this all going straight to hell, so..That too, and all the knock-on effects thereof.<br /> <br /> You also just boned anybody whose livelihood depended on selling light. Anybody dealing in lamps, lamp oil, the harvesting of plants or animals from whence high-end lantern oil is derived, and so on? Is going to hate your guts. That stuff used to be highly profitable until you came along.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24387,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24387-amayad","user":"Amayad","date":". 09-19-2018, 12:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24387-amayad","name":"Amayad","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"137"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-19T18:58:15-07:00","id":1255633,"title":"","content":"Ah. Luddites. Always a thing. <br /> <br /> 2 more ideas. From sunder the gold.<br /> <br /> A set of glowing plants that flower all year round. The lights, leaves, and flowers all form patterns that, if one knows how to look, can serve as tutors in any ability or specialty. <br /> <br /> A plant that quickly regenerates leaves. The leaves, when crushed by a mortar and then scattered into a barrels worth of water, causes dirt and detritus to clump and sink to the bottom, as well as purifying the water of poison and disease.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-21T02:03:15-07:00","id":1256037,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1255633#post1255633\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ah. Luddites. Always a thing.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, but luddites were working-class folk worried about how new machines would cost them their jobs - the jobs still mostly needed doing, it's just that we could do them with way less labor now. This is going to piss off rich folks too -oil was a hell of a trade commodity until you made an end-run around it.<br /> <br /> Personally though? I'd say if you want to be Solar Edison, get Craft down to The Art of Permanence and start banging out lanterns.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1255633#post1255633\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> A plant that quickly regenerates leaves. The leaves, when crushed by a mortar and then scattered into a barrels worth of water, causes dirt and detritus to clump and sink to the bottom, as well as purifying the water of poison and disease.<br /> <br /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Obvious question: is salt &quot;dirt and detritus&quot; for these purposes? Is saltwater a poison? <br /> <br /> I'm going with Terrestrial 3 there<br /> <br /> Create a completely new but mundane form of life, or <b> breed a specimen of an existing species with a minor supernatural power that augments its strongest traits.</b><br /> <br /> There are plants that filter water already., such as irises, bullrushes and water lilies. You could make a supernaturally effective one that acts as a much better filter against poison and disease if you want. I'm not sure if I'd let the powdered remains of the plant work, but I'd totally let a sorcerer put a potted lily in a barrel of diseased water and purify it.<br /> <br /> \\Or you could use a Terrestrial 3 working to just make a local water source remain clean and pure. Much handier for the locals, but less portable.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1255633#post1255633\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> A set of glowing plants that flower all year round. The lights, leaves, and flowers all form patterns that, if one knows how to look, can serve as tutors in any ability or specialty.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Now that, that's at least Celestial 1 or so and I'd expect Means like &quot;powdered dreamstones used by savants&quot;. They bloom all year because their lessons correspond to the dominant constellations. You can learn any style of Martial Arts this side of Heaven from these things, but only in the months where The Sword is ascendant.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24387-amayad","name":"Amayad","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"137"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-21T02:25:35-07:00","id":1256041,"title":"","content":"Yes. But would such a plant be able to reproduce?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-21T03:15:32-07:00","id":1256050,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1256041#post1256041\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yes. But would such a plant be able to reproduce?</div> </div> </div> </div>Isn't that up to you and your ST and the Finesse you set?<br /> <br /> Me, I'd assume that the plant itself can reproduce, sure, but its offspring might need to undergo similar treatments in order to have any knowledge to impart.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 09-21-2018, 06:17 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-21T03:22:25-07:00","id":1256052,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1256050#post1256050\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Isn't that up to you and your ST and the Finesse you set?<br /> <br /> Me, I'd assume that the plant itself can reproduce, sure, but its offspring might need to undergo similar treatments in order to have any knowledge to impart.</div> </div> </div> </div>..... sorry to tell you this, but I only think of interesting things for sorcerous workings. <br /> <br /> I have never played a game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-21T03:30:08-07:00","id":1256056,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1256052#post1256052\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u2026sorry to tell you this\u2026</div> </div> </div> </div>Why be sorry? There's more than a few people on this board who don't play all that much Exalted. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1256052#post1256052\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have never played a game.</div> </div> </div> </div>Give it a shot. It's fun. And if nothing else, maybe getting some play under your belt will give you a better feeling for it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-21T03:45:59-07:00","id":1256059,"title":"","content":"I'd say that a new magical species of water lily could reproduce - those things are like invasive waterborne weeds. getting them to *stop* reproducing takes serious effort. They might actually feed on poison, filth and disease, though, (depending on your finesse and how much your GM cares about open-source water purification) meaning that once the area's purified, you'll have to transplant them into a new pit of fetid nastiness if you want to build their numbers.<br /> <br /> The knowledge-bushes? They make seeds, but if you want them to grow into other knowledge-bushes rather than mundane plants with pretty flowers, I'd probably require you to ritually prepare and purify a new site for them, which is in itself a Celestial working with a goal number of 20. So, way easier than making them in the first place. and easier than a Celestial working should be, but you still need proper initiation to quickly perform the geomantic shaping required to attune them to the constellations.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24387-amayad","name":"Amayad","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"137"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-21T03:53:00-07:00","id":1256061,"title":"","content":"Oh yeah. I just remembered. <br /> <br /> Those knowledge blossoms? By sunder the gold. In the lunar exclusive infrastructure thread. <br /> <br /> Maybe the knowledge bushes can be celestial 2, instead? I mean, knowledge can't be more important than mutations...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-21T03:55:11-07:00","id":1256062,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1256061#post1256061\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">knowledge can't be more important than mutations...</div> </div> </div> </div>Gonna disagree, here.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-21T04:19:48-07:00","id":1256064,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1256062#post1256062\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Gonna disagree, here.</div> </div> </div> </div>How so? I mean, it won't stop you from bleeding to death. Nor let you fight off bandits. Yes. Teach melee. What else? Not much use in surviving even 1st circle demons.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-21T05:02:26-07:00","id":1256067,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1256064#post1256064\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How so? I mean, it won't stop you from bleeding to death. Nor let you fight off bandits. Yes. Teach melee. What else? Not much use in surviving even 1st circle demons.</div> </div> </div> </div>Please stop downplaying the significance of your suggested workings. You've consistently suggested introducing large, even huge-scale changes to the standard of living in the setting via sorcery, stuff that fundamentally changes the nature of warfare, or education, or healthcare, or agriculture, or just the human condition. You've done it for dozens of pages. <i>Please own it</i>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 09-21-2018, 08:05 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-21T05:40:27-07:00","id":1256070,"title":"","content":"Alright fine. Maybe my sense of scale is different from others..... Maybe. i'm not sure. <br /> <br /> Though agriculture? Fine. Lights? fine. <br /> <br /> But what do you mean about the human condition?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-21T05:50:44-07:00","id":1256072,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1256070#post1256070\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But what do you mean about the human condition?</div> </div> </div> </div>You've asked about changing people into &quot;mini-Exalts.&quot; You've asked for Space Marines. About what it takes to be able to consistently turn humans into demons. You've asked about giving people sorcery, Excellencies, Charms, thaumaturgy, mutations, and so on.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 09-21-2018, 08:53 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-21T05:52:21-07:00","id":1256073,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1256072#post1256072\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You've asked about changing people into &quot;mini-Exalts.&quot; You've asked for Space Marines. About what it takes to be able to consistently turn humans into demons. You've asked about giving people Charms, thaumaturgy, mutations, and so on.</div> </div> </div> </div>Bah. That's just a power boost. Its not like I'm asking to change the entire human race at once. Besides, I don't think that i've made any actual sorcerous workings like that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-21T05:57:32-07:00","id":1256074,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1256073#post1256073\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Besides, I don't think that i've made any actual sorcerous workings like that.</div> </div> </div> </div>By your own admission, you've never played Exalted before, so, yes, this is true. <br /> <br /> But you've <i>reliably</i> come to this thread to ask us about these kinds of projects, and disagreed with us, or &quot;sigh&quot;-ed, or said &quot;Fine then,&quot; whenever we didn't rate your Working at Terrestrial 3 or whatever you felt was appropriate. All I want you to do is own that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 09-21-2018, 09:00 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-21T06:05:58-07:00","id":1256078,"title":"","content":"To be fair, there's nothing wrong with large-scale improvements to the standard of living in Creation - that's called &quot;rebuilding the First Age by degrees&quot; and is absolutely the purview of Solars.<br /> <br /> But in order to get a handle on exactly what kind of miracles you're performing, it helps to get an idea of how the average mortal in Creation lives:<br /> <br /> *Most people are illiterate. This is mostly because being literate takes effort and won't get you much payoff as a laborer.<br /> *Most people have to worry about infection, disease, starvation and such.<br /> *Most people live and die within 100 miles of their birthplace. Travel is slow.<br /> *For most people, the sight of a first-circle demon is cause for serious concern. You don't charge a Blood Ape, you have your wise folk burn *all* the offerings to your patron god while you round up fifty militiamen to stab it to death.<br /> <br /> This is assuming you don't decide to worship it, which is absolutely an option. It is about as powerful as your local god, and is clearly paying way more attention to you right now.<br /> <br /> So, picture the historical Iron Age, except that magic exists. For most of the world it really doesn't make up for the fact that angry gods and monsters also exist.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24387-amayad","name":"Amayad","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"137"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-21T06:16:34-07:00","id":1256082,"title":"","content":"So.... if I was to play a game, I would probably be the guy trying to pull a Salina?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-21T07:15:06-07:00","id":1256096,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1256082#post1256082\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So.... if I was to play a game, I would probably be the guy trying to pull a Salina?</div> </div> </div> </div>Most likely! And you can definitely do things like her Open Sourcery Project , but not for anything less than a Solar Working.<br /> <br /> Mind you, that doesn't mean you have to have Solar Circle Sorcery to do it. Celestial Initiation and a lot of reckless disregard for your own limitations can get you Solar Workings.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24387-amayad","name":"Amayad","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"137"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-21T08:04:20-07:00","id":1256102,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Amayad</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1256096#post1256096\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Most likely! And you can definitely do things like her Open Sourcery Project , but not for anything less than a Solar Working.<br /> <br /> Mind you, that doesn't mean you have to have Solar Circle Sorcery to do it. Celestial Initiation and a lot of reckless disregard for your own limitations can get you Solar Workings.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes yes Yes! And a sorcerous working across creation, to make all subsequent workings easier. Maybe a decrease in difficulty or more intervals.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-21T09:58:31-07:00","id":1256135,"title":"","content":"I'm not sure if..Meta-sorcery is a thing. Surely if it were possible to do, the First Age Solars would have done it to further their own ends by now. Hell, maybe they already did, and this is as easy as magic can be made on a Creation-wide scale.<br /> <br /> But there are ways to make workings easier for you, they're called &quot;means&quot;, and you certainly can acquire some with sorcery. Demonic assistants that are themselves capable of sorcery generally do make things easier.<br /> <br /> And now, a Working of my own!<br /> <br /> Suppose I want a yakhchal that doesn't need a water or wind supply - it just produces ice from the locally altered geomancy. I moved to Gem for the company, but my vast wealth still can't deliver chilled wine, and this is a travesty I am willing to bend the world in order to rectify.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24387-amayad","name":"Amayad","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"137"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-21T10:14:38-07:00","id":1256142,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Amayad</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1256135#post1256135\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Suppose I want a yakhchal that doesn't need a water or wind supply - it just produces ice from the locally altered geomancy. </div> </div> </div> </div>I'd definitely call this Terrestrial, with the precise amount of ice produced determining the exact ambition. If it was enough to keep just one person in chilled drinks all day, or a small party to each have one drink, that's 1. If it were enough to keep a small party in chilled drinks all day, that's Ambition 2. And if it's enough to keep a small <i>community</i> in chilled drinks all day, that's Ambition 3. In particular, the quantity you'd need to seriously make money selling ice would probably need to be Ambition 3, I think.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Interested in chatting with other Exalted fans online? Join us on the <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kGsyF5jhdy\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted Discord server</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1533-kelly-pedersen","name":"Kelly Pedersen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1533_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"929"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-21T22:03:15-07:00","id":1256371,"title":"","content":"Question. Can't elementals create ice?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-21T23:54:09-07:00","id":1256381,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1256371#post1256371\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Question. Can't elementals create ice?</div> </div> </div> </div>There's no canonical one that does, but no reason to assume that it's categorically impossible.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-22T00:08:11-07:00","id":1256382,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1256381#post1256381\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There's no canonical one that does, but no reason to assume that it's categorically impossible.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah. Which reminds me. <br /> <br /> Certain wastelands and deserts in Creation play host to ludicrously profitable trade routes, which are only used so rarely because of the danger, and the need for supplies. <br /> <br /> Half-way houses are places with sorcerous workings placed upon them, which mitigate the environmental dangers and provide food and water for places so far from any form of sustenance. Being the only place with food and water and shelter for hundreds of miles about, the owner of the half-way house can set any price and put any condition, and the traders have to follow them. <br /> <br /> Such as the fact that the caravans may not carry slaves.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-22T02:18:33-07:00","id":1256407,"title":"","content":"Not a bad idea. I'd peg that as a Celestial 1.<br /> <br /> Transform a chamber so that its interior emulates the environment of any natural terrain within Creation.<br /> <br /> Godforsaken wasteland outside, fertile near-Eastern wilderness inside, problem solved!<br /> <br /> You may need to follow up with a Terrestrial 3 to make the place supernaturally abundant, depending on how many traders you expect to use it, or maybe just a Terrestrial 1 to make dutiful, magical groundskeepers and gardeners. <br /> <br /> To enforce your will, you may also need a Celestial 1 (ward the place against all intruders with magical barriers) a Celestial 2 (grant the whole structure the ability to rearrange itself such that scumbags find nothing but thorns and malice) or a Terrestrial 2 (just enchant the heavy-ass door with human-level intelligence and tell it the rules.)<br /> <br /> That's assuming you want to do the whole thing with nothing but Workings. You might save yourself some trouble by binding a guardian elemental to the place for a year and a day, or using Tiger Warrior Training to raise up a band of elite badass road wardens who specialize in flipping off slavers. I'm sure you can find people that'd gladly pack up their lives to move to the edge of the world and live in relative comfort.<br /> <br /> Say, for instance, that band of emancipated slaves you've been accumulating.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24387-amayad","name":"Amayad","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"137"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-22T02:36:30-07:00","id":1256410,"title":"","content":"Hmm.... part of it was also putting part of it as a manse. I mean, I didn't see the manse rules for 3e, but it's basically a manse with no hearth stone that has environmental control and provider. The supernatural durability and also building it with fortifications. I mean... what are you going to do? Siege it? It's got infinite food and water, while you're stuck in the wastelands. And if you try to bypass it with your caravan, it'll launch an attack from behind you.<br /> <br /> So yes. No slaves.<br /> <br /> Which reminds me. Is a merit that makes people far more inclined to think well of you and be friendly supernatural or natural?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-22T03:37:58-07:00","id":1256419,"title":"","content":"Well, step one is finding or shaping a demesne on the spot you want. I'd say the process of reshaping an already-present demesne's aspect (say, from Fire to Wood) is a Craft (Geomancy) project about as difficult as a Celestial 2 Working. Then you use the Manse-raising rules on 243.<br /> <br /> For this experiment you will require: a whole lot of bound spirits, When undertaking a massive construction project in a blasted wasteland, I strongly suggest recruiting workers that don't need to eat.<br /> <br /> Get to work, Solomon.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24387-amayad","name":"Amayad","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"137"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-22T04:01:18-07:00","id":1256426,"title":"","content":"Hopping puppeteers. <br /> <br /> See? Demons solve everything.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-24T21:03:28-07:00","id":1257079,"title":"","content":"An idea. A bell, that hangs in the town square. Rang every night and morning and noon.<br /> <br /> Various possible uses:<br /> <br /> 1. Drives away creatures of darkness<br /> 2. Breaks all unnatural influence effects or makes them obvious<br /> 3. Drives away all pests and stuff.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-25T02:52:06-07:00","id":1257137,"title":"","content":"Lessee here...<br /> <br /> Driving away creatures of darkness? Terrestrial 3 or so. Similar to, but greater than, Terrestrial 2's &quot;ward a chamber against scrying, teleportation, or intrusion by a particular type of spirit.&quot; I'd have the bellringer roll the sorcerer's Intelligence+Occult pool with one automatic success to Instill fear or disgust in any creatures of darkness within earshot. They can still spend willpower,, or be driven on by a greater influence, but this'll keep your village on the edge of a shadowland from being incidentally wiped out by hungry ghosts.<br /> <br /> For more stubborn boojums, you'll have to show up yourself and kick the ringleader in the teeth, like ya do.<br /> <br /> Driving away all mundane pests? About a Terrestrial 2.<br /> <br /> Breaking all unnatural influence (except those that explicitly cannot be broken)? My inclination is &quot;that's a stationary Artifact 5 built into the local geomancy&quot;. But if I were to allow it as a working, Solar 2. with dire costs for both the bellringer and anyone set free.<br /> <br /> Making all unnatural influence obvious, if it isn't already? Way easier, about a Celestial 1 or so, with the how and why depending on your Finesse.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24387-amayad","name":"Amayad","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"137"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-25T03:42:22-07:00","id":1257146,"title":"","content":"Huh. So.... unnatural mental influence is the deal breaker?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-25T05:01:48-07:00","id":1257163,"title":"","content":"Some mortal rings a magic bell and everybody within a few miles snaps out of any and all mindfuckery? Yeah, big deal. This completely borks:<br /> <br /> Corrupted Words.<br /> <br /> Nine out of ten things involving the Fair Folk.<br /> <br /> Cheating Sigereth<br /> <br /> Several Essence 3+ Dragonblooded charms that only work once per story, or only once on any given person.<br /> <br /> Voice-Caging Caligraphy. Memory-Reweaving Discipline and so on.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24387-amayad","name":"Amayad","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"137"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-25T05:33:59-07:00","id":1257172,"title":"","content":"How about a small bell? Like, local level. Less than 50 meters. I like how the bells can be used as a symbol for 'waking up', letting people recover from unnatural mental influences or trances.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-26T03:52:51-07:00","id":1257337,"title":"","content":"Ooof. More ideas. Celestial Circle. Let's try out the Evil Eye. <br /> <br /> 1. Within one month, the target will die. It will be seemingly by accident. Whether a sudden heart attack, a clog in a brain vessel, slipping down the stairs, or a frozen turkey from a passing plane... he will die. The downside, is that it only works on mortals. <br /> <br /> 2. The target receives a botch, and the sorcerer can choose when this happens. Perhaps the next time the target fights an opponent, he slips and falls prone, and is slain. Perhaps a careless remark breaks his relationship with his wife. Or maybe so. <br /> <br /> So?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-26T10:02:28-07:00","id":1257390,"title":"","content":"Sorcery's a lot of things, but I don't think &quot;subtle&quot; is one of them. That kind of thing is what Sidereals should get up to, if anything.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24387-amayad","name":"Amayad","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"137"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-26T17:16:19-07:00","id":1257470,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Amayad</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1257390#post1257390\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sorcery's a lot of things, but I don't think &amp;quot;subtle&amp;quot; is one of them. That kind of thing is what Sidereals should get up to, if anything.</div> </div> </div> </div>Don't we have a poison touch and a dream attack?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-26T23:39:31-07:00","id":1257505,"title":"","content":"We do. Those are relatively subtle spells by Sorcery's standards. but Assassin's Fatal Touch can be diagnosed by supernatural investigation, and Silent Words of Dreams and Nightmares sends dreams and nightmares to people - who then know they're having oddly vivid dreams.<br /> <br /> Cursing people such that the world plots to kill them via terminal misfortune? That's Sidereal Astrology.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24387-amayad","name":"Amayad","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"137"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-08T11:26:06-07:00","id":1259625,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Amayad</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1257505#post1257505\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">We do. Those are relatively subtle spells by Sorcery's standards. but Assassin's Fatal Touch can be diagnosed by supernatural investigation, and Silent Words of Dreams and Nightmares sends dreams and nightmares to people - who then know they're having oddly vivid dreams.<br /> <br /> Cursing people such that the world plots to kill them via terminal misfortune? That's Sidereal Astrology.</div> </div> </div> </div>Damn. What about this, then? Anyone with a hint of supernatural power, like sorcerers or god-blooded, can see the lingering doom on the person. The person himself feels a massive level of dread and fear as he tries to escape his impending death.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-11T04:42:11-07:00","id":1260106,"title":"","content":"Idea: zone of silence. A working cast on a person that makes it so that the person cannot be seen by scrying or remote tracking powers.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-11T05:09:45-07:00","id":1260109,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1260106#post1260106\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Idea: zone of silence. A working cast on a person that makes it so that the person cannot be seen by scrying or remote tracking powers.</div> </div> </div> </div>Every fashionable castle needs one!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cone_of_Silence_(Get_Smart)\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/3/31/Get_Smart.gif?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=index&amp;utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cone_of_Silence_(Get_Smart)\" target=\"_blank\"> Get Smart - Wikipedia </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cone_of_Silence_(Get_Smart)\" target=\"_blank\"> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cone_of_Silence_(Get_Smart) </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1188890-momentum-exalted\" target=\"_blank\">Momentum Exalted!</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6192-simon-darkstep","name":"Simon Darkstep","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-12T18:23:20-07:00","id":1260379,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1260106#post1260106\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Idea: zone of silence. A working cast on a person that makes it so that the person cannot be seen by scrying or remote tracking powers.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hm! I'd call that a good use of Celestial 2's &quot;grant a supernatural power&quot; option. Warding a chamber against scrying is Terrestrial 2, but making that effect follow a particular person is way more useful - because, y'know, they can still go about and live their lives without being spied on.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24387-amayad","name":"Amayad","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"137"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-12T22:17:14-07:00","id":1260398,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Amayad</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1260379#post1260379\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Hm! I'd call that a good use of Celestial 2's &quot;grant a supernatural power&quot; option. Warding a chamber against scrying is Terrestrial 2, but making that effect follow a particular person is way more useful - because, y'know, they can still go about and live their lives without being spied on.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, but I was thinking..... <br /> <br /> So! Ward a chamber against scrying is terrestrial 2. But the things is, they never said how it manifested. So how about 4 figurines of jade, whose hands cover their eyes. Put them at 4 corners, and then boom! Its warded. Portable, and easy to hide. You can pretend that they're decorations. The thing is, if you can make the effect portable, does it count as terrestrial 3?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-13T00:42:58-07:00","id":1260405,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1260398#post1260398\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah, but I was thinking.....<br /> <br /> So! Ward a chamber against scrying is terrestrial 2. But the things is, they never said how it manifested. So how about 4 figurines of jade, whose hands cover their eyes. Put them at 4 corners, and then boom! Its warded. Portable, and easy to hide. You can pretend that they're decorations. The thing is, if you can make the effect portable, does it count as terrestrial 3?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> That sounds more like it is in the domain of artifice to me. Great idea for an artifact though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/15748-carrot-crusader","name":"Carrot Crusader","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-13T11:00:25-07:00","id":1260440,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Carrot Crusader</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1260405#post1260405\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> That sounds more like it is in the domain of artifice to me. Great idea for an artifact though.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hmmm..... can't you attach sorcerous workings to artifacts?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-13T12:06:48-07:00","id":1260444,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1260398#post1260398\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah, but I was thinking.....<br /> <br /> So! Ward a chamber against scrying is terrestrial 2. But the things is, they never said how it manifested. So how about 4 figurines of jade, whose hands cover their eyes. Put them at 4 corners, and then boom! Its warded. Portable, and easy to hide. You can pretend that they're decorations. The thing is, if you can make the effect portable, does it count as terrestrial 3?</div> </div> </div> </div>that could be a cuestion for the Ask the devs thread. Ic could see that as either higher circle or higher finesse depending on how you sell it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12483-ale137","name":"ale137","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-13T19:53:49-07:00","id":1260473,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ale137</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1260444#post1260444\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">that could be a cuestion for the Ask the devs thread. Ic could see that as either higher circle or higher finesse depending on how you sell it.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's not what Finesse is.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-14T00:32:53-07:00","id":1260486,"title":"","content":"Actually, that's a thing. Can you alter the way the workings manifest, to get a bit more.... ooomph, out of them? Instead of enchanting a field to always be fertile, you can instead enchant a statue that blesses the field, so that when you gotta move, you can just move the statue instead of leaving the field there. Or if you gotta do stuff like, say, make a spring with water that stops bleeding and infection, you can instead make a cup that transforms all liquid inside of it into healing water.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-14T04:20:59-07:00","id":1260501,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1260440#post1260440\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Hmmm..... can't you attach sorcerous workings to artifacts?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> It being an artifact or not has no bearing, in general, when it comes to artifice. If it is a working you allow for mundane objects, same usually applies to artifice. So if you have 4 jade artifact statues that say ward against the elements, could you make a working that also makes it protect against scrying? I would say no. But it might be suitable for an evocation or crafting of a matching starmetal statue witch expand upon the sets capabilities.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/15748-carrot-crusader","name":"Carrot Crusader","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-14T04:26:17-07:00","id":1260502,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1260486#post1260486\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Actually, that's a thing. Can you alter the way the workings manifest, to get a bit more.... ooomph, out of them? Instead of enchanting a field to always be fertile, you can instead enchant a statue that blesses the field, so that when you gotta move, you can just move the statue instead of leaving the field there. Or if you gotta do stuff like, say, make a spring with water that stops bleeding and infection, you can instead make a cup that transforms all liquid inside of it into healing water.</div> </div> </div> </div>Again, sounds like the domain of hearthstones and artifice to me.<br /> <br /> Finesse is to answer the question &quot;who has control over the quirks of the working&quot;<br /> <br /> Take the example of a supernaturally fertile field<br /> <br /> Finesse one, the storyteller decides. It can be pretty much anything but it has to keep the fact that it makes a fertile field. They might, for example, decide that unless the field is circled by goat blood during calibration, it wont work the following year.<br /> <br /> Finesse three, the player and storyteller comes to an agreement. Maybe you are not so hot on the goat blood idea so the two of you agree that a statue of the players character have to be in the center of the field and be reguralrly maintained. If it is moved or fall in disrepair, the working stops until it is rectified.<br /> <br /> Finesse five, the players have almost complete control. You can just say &quot;it does what it says on the bottle, nothing else.&quot; Though I think a working should always have a quirk, if only to make it more interesting.<br /> <br /> A working that &quot;makes a statue cause its surrounding to area to be fertile&quot; is a completely different working. One I would not allow as it falls under artifice (and hearthstones)<br /> <br /> Remember that a working that is no longer relevant to the story returns the exp. So if you enhance a field and then leave. Assuming you and the ST don't think you will return and you don't have ongoing benefits from it (taxes for example) then the exp is returned witch you can spend on a different field.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":15748,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/15748-carrot-crusader","user":"Carrot Crusader","date":". 10-14-2018, 07:40 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/15748-carrot-crusader","name":"Carrot Crusader","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-14T04:35:02-07:00","id":1260503,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1260486#post1260486\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Actually, that's a thing. Can you alter the way the workings manifest, to get a bit more.... ooomph, out of them? Instead of enchanting a field to always be fertile, you can instead enchant a statue that blesses the field, so that when you gotta move, you can just move the statue instead of leaving the field there. Or if you gotta do stuff like, say, make a spring with water that stops bleeding and infection, you can instead make a cup that transforms all liquid inside of it into healing water.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Statue? Sure. <br /> Cup? Also sure. Yeah, you can make workings that are objects. One of the examples is a walking castle...I mean, walking lab.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-14T04:39:01-07:00","id":1260505,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1260398#post1260398\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah, but I was thinking.....<br /> <br /> So! Ward a chamber against scrying is terrestrial 2. But the things is, they never said how it manifested. So how about 4 figurines of jade, whose hands cover their eyes. Put them at 4 corners, and then boom! Its warded. Portable, and easy to hide. You can pretend that they're decorations. The thing is, if you can make the effect portable, does it count as terrestrial 3?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I'd make it Terrestrial 3 for the mobility.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-14T06:38:43-07:00","id":1260508,"title":"","content":"Anyone here read asoiaf? <br /> <br /> If I want to stat up a dragon, would it count as a first circle or second circle?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-14T10:32:15-07:00","id":1260535,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1260508#post1260508\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Anyone here read asoiaf?<br /> <br /> If I want to stat up a dragon, would it count as a first circle or second circle?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Assuming you mean &quot;how would I go about creating a dragon as if depicted in asoiaf with sorcerous workings?&quot; so you are not interested in elemental dragons and such.<br /> <br /> 1. Terrestrial 3: Fire breathing bats<br /> <br /> 2a. River dragon+fire bat could give the body of a dragon. Maybe one more animal to give it legs (up to ST if they can get that from the bat or not). So that is 1-2 terrestrial ambition 2 workings. As a bonus, it is amphibious and has sonar.<br /> <br /> 2b. Tyrant lizard+fire bat. Lose some amphibious but definatly 1 terrestial ambition 2 working.<br /> <br /> Creating a lesser elemental dragon is celestial 3.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":15748,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/15748-carrot-crusader","user":"Carrot Crusader","date":". 10-14-2018, 01:39 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/15748-carrot-crusader","name":"Carrot Crusader","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-15T06:55:22-07:00","id":1260657,"title":"","content":"Any creature in creation that are naturally firebreathing?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-15T07:53:53-07:00","id":1260674,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1260657#post1260657\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Any creature in creation that are naturally firebreathing?</div> </div> </div> </div>Not as yet.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-16T02:12:51-07:00","id":1260869,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1260674#post1260674\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not as yet.</div> </div> </div> </div>...... I now know where creations monsters come from.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-16T07:47:32-07:00","id":1260904,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1260869#post1260869\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> ...... I now know where creations monsters come from.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, it's a great big world out there, and the material published in the books only covers a tiny, tiny bit of the vast distances and timescales involved in Creation. Some species may have been spawned by First Age Cocaine Wizardry (we know of at least a small handful that definitely were), but it's also not unthinkable that there are natural &quot;firebreathing&quot; beasties we just haven't covered yet.<br /> <br /> If there are, though, they're probably fairly low-key things, like a lizard capable of doing the bombardier beetle trick (boiling high-pressure gouts of nastiness) from its mouth a few times. For actual firebreathing dragons (that are not spirits) I think you'll need some flavor of supernature.<br /> <br /> Which doesn't have to be a Working. With enough Survival you can explicitly make a Charizard, albeit one that only gets temporary bouts of dragonhood","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24387-amayad","name":"Amayad","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"137"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-16T16:43:49-07:00","id":1261023,"title":"","content":"Wait a second. What about if we do a eugenics breeding program, involving bombarded beetles, elementals, bats, and lizards?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-16T18:48:10-07:00","id":1261036,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1261023#post1261023\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wait a second. What about if we do a eugenics breeding program, involving bombarded beetles,<b> elementals</b>, bats, and lizards?</div> </div> </div> </div>1) I don't think this will result in a &quot;natural animal.&quot;<br /> 2) You're still going to need a neomah or the Wyld to facilitate the cross-species stuff.<br /> 3) This is starting to sound like a <i>series</i> of workings.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-18T01:46:43-07:00","id":1261257,"title":"","content":"Holy shit. I forgot. <br /> <br /> We need a catbus! We need a motherfucking catbus, stat!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-23T22:03:18-07:00","id":1262476,"title":"","content":"A question. A constant problem with bronze age is light. Like.... we need light. <br /> <br /> Question. Artificial sun. One city. Celestial 2 or 3?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-25T05:07:46-07:00","id":1262659,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1262476#post1262476\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A question. A constant problem with bronze age is light. Like.... we need light.<br /> <br /> Question. Artificial sun. One city. Celestial 2 or 3?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Specifically an &quot;artificial sun&quot;? Depends, could be a sun spirit (C3), a construct that emitts light (C3) or a supernatural power to an entity (Emit sunlight, C2). I Would probably permit C2 for a localised sun.<br /> <br /> Other ways to grant illumination to a city can be done at terrestrial of course.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/15748-carrot-crusader","name":"Carrot Crusader","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-25T06:20:21-07:00","id":1262666,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Carrot Crusader</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1262659#post1262659\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Other ways to grant illumination to a city can be done at terrestrial of course.</div> </div> </div> </div>Woah. Like what?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-26T03:23:13-07:00","id":1262819,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/733522-sorcerous-workings-where-we-make-judgments?p=1262666#post1262666\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Woah. Like what?</div> </div> </div> </div>Ever-burning torches, patroling squads of bound fire elementals, and light-emitting rocks are some examples.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""}